== what landed this session ==

### visualization bug fixes
- orbital.json ]> suffix: orbital.json.tmpl used nested <[meta.context]> inside
  outer <[...]> — non-greedy ]> matching left trailing ]> breaking JSON parse
  silently in browser (nodes not showing). fixed: use <{context}> meta var syntax
- arrow keys: restored to moveSelection (cursor movement, camera lazy-follows)
- RMB mirroring LMB: mousedown/mouseup now guard e.button !== 0
- contextmenu: preventDefault on canvas so browser menu opens cleanly
- B/P key focus: blur activeElement at keydown entry, button focus no longer
  intercepts shortcuts
- panel toggle key: was B (broken — controls div had no id), now P, both
  #controls and #orbitalControls hidden/shown together
- slider styling: -webkit-appearance reset, styled track + thumb, eliminates
  browser offset artifacts. good template for future sliders.

