== design conversations this session ==

### attention state machine + curve composability
- named states: ambient / single-focus / group-view / path-attention /
  formation-survey / free-traverse
- state stack with push/pop/blend, sub-session memory, transition curves
- curve sets per state: setCurveSet() already wired as stub
- layered curve mappings with context + priority based dynamic switching
- base.curve arrival: lerp constants → named curve lookups already done

### liquid crystal desktop vision
- visualization is a translucent circuit board desktop
- elements are luminous planes with semantic depth, not widgets on canvas
- translucency IS function — panels display data through their depth
- brightness distinguishes foreground/background without breaking material
  continuity (same principle as LCD polarization depth)

### navigation interaction model
- 3D grid cursor (arrow keys): field-of-awareness cursor, camera lazy-follows
- 2D screen cursor (mouse): ray cast from screen plane into harmonic space
- camera: follower not controller, lerps toward attention target
- navigation modes (context-driven): orbital / grid / formation / trajectory
- magnetic snap to real grid addresses (deferred until network spans grid)
- base.curve shapes all transitions: arrival easing, deceleration near
  attractor density, mode-switch blending

