== key technical notes ==

- orbital.json.tmpl: use <{varname}> (meta var) never <[meta.varname]>
  (nested command) — non-greedy ]> matching breaks outer command parsing
- CURVES config block in visualization.html: all lerp constants named,
  setCurveSet('ambient'|'focus'|'survey') for runtime tuning
- attention machine: p7c plugin.web.attention.cmd.set-state <name>
  /attention.json polls every 7s, curve_set wiring stub is commented in
  fetchAttentionData() — uncomment when attention machine is driving curves
- NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1 needed for local curl but use --noproxy '*' for vhost
  testing (hysteria proxy to atom intercepts otherwise)
- kimi-task: UTF-8 arrow → fixed to ASCII -> in encoded byte-count line
- kimi auth: CLI login (/login in kimi CLI) needed after backend restart,
  then restart web backend so zenka reconnects with fresh auth

